{"id":"663638","name":"腌笃鲜","author":"zhangaiwen","authorId":"9213624","desc":"","cover":"images/663638/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"咸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"冬笋","amount":"一个"},{"name":"千张","amount":"适量"},{"name":"木耳","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱结","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生姜","amount":"3片"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"咸肉洗净，蒸半熟，切厚片。","img":"images/663638/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"木耳泡发，与笋片焯水备用。","img":"images/663638/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅热倒少许油，煸炒咸肉，至微焦色，放生姜葱结。","img":"images/663638/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煸炒咸肉出香味，倒入适量开水，煮沸。","img":"images/663638/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"笋片，木耳，千张结放入锅底，将煮沸的咸肉汤倒入锅内。","img":"images/663638/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"大火烧开。","img":"images/663638/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"转小火煮20分钟，调味出锅，即可。","img":"images/663638/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒上葱段，成品如上，鲜香可口。","img":"images/663638/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}